  "student_passage": "Nora: Hello, Dad. This is Nora. Can you collect me at the school gate today?\nDad: Yes. Your music lesson usually ends at four. Shall I come then?\nNora: Not today. A book bus is coming to school after the lesson. I want to choose a book, so please come at half past four.\nDad: All right. Is the bus selling books?\nNora: No. We can borrow one book for a week. We must bring our school cards.\nDad: Your card is in the small pocket of your bag.\nNora: Yes, I have it. The bus will be beside the playground. Only our class is visiting it today; other classes will go tomorrow.\nDad: Fine. I'll wait at the gate, not beside the bus.\nNora: Thank you. See you there.",
